1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,286
Meet Ray.

2
00:00:01,326 --> 00:00:02,124
One morning,

3
00:00:02,164 --> 00:00:03,613
every other man on Earth

4
00:00:03,653 --> 00:00:04,539
is gone.

5
00:00:04,579 --> 00:00:05,390
"So I'm kind of

6
00:00:05,430 --> 00:00:06,441
a big deal now,"

7
00:00:06,481 --> 00:00:07,366
he says.

8
00:00:07,406 --> 00:00:08,430
His sister Maya

9
00:00:08,470 --> 00:00:09,781
isn't impressed.

10
00:00:09,821 --> 00:00:10,620
In New York,

11
00:00:10,660 --> 00:00:11,683
the fire department

12
00:00:11,723 --> 00:00:13,373
just lost almost everyone,

13
00:00:13,413 --> 00:00:15,075
because fewer than two percent

14
00:00:15,115 --> 00:00:16,351
of its firefighters

15
00:00:16,391 --> 00:00:17,490
are women.

16
00:00:17,530 --> 00:00:18,966
Across America,

17
00:00:19,006 --> 00:00:20,669
about ninety-seven percent

18
00:00:20,709 --> 00:00:22,358
