19
00:00:22,398 --> 00:00:23,847
so Maya grabs a toolbox

20
00:00:23,887 --> 00:00:24,986
and learns fast.

21
00:00:25,026 --> 00:00:26,037
In Rwanda,

22
00:00:26,077 --> 00:00:27,739
a parliament that's already

23
00:00:27,779 --> 00:00:28,590
mostly women

24
00:00:28,630 --> 00:00:29,728
keeps working.

25
00:00:29,768 --> 00:00:31,079
And the future?

26
00:00:31,119 --> 00:00:31,717
Frozen sperm

27
00:00:31,757 --> 00:00:32,981
can last for decades,

28
00:00:33,021 --> 00:00:34,045
so new baby boys

29
00:00:34,085 --> 00:00:34,683
could arrive

30
00:00:34,723 --> 00:00:36,460
within about a year.

31
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:38,662
Ray isn't special anymore.

32
00:00:38,702 --> 00:00:40,213
"Good," Maya says.

